(Carrier QRG Auto-Update v1 Runbook) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#Objective) Tj
T*
(Automatically detect and ingest carrier Quick Reference Guide \(QRG\) updates into Google Drive) Tj
T*
(without manual re-upload, while preserving compliance, quality control, and auditability.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#1\) Scope) Tj
T*
(- In scope: Carrier QRG PDFs/docs, underwriting bulletins, appetite/reference docs tied to) Tj
T*
(carrier access workflows.) Tj
T*
(- Out of scope \(v1\): Deep policy form parsing, OCR-heavy scanned images with poor quality, non-) Tj
T*
(authorized source scraping.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#2\) Source of Truth) Tj
T*
(Use Google Drive as canonical storage.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(##Folder Standard) Tj
T*
(`/Carriers/{CarrierName}/QRG/`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(##Naming Convention) Tj
T*
(`{CarrierName}-QRG-{YYYY-MM-DD}-v{N}.pdf`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(##Required Metadata \(stored in index sheet + file description\)) Tj
T*
(- Carrier name) Tj
T*
(- Source URL) Tj
T*
(- Last checked timestamp) Tj
T*
(- Last changed timestamp) Tj
T*
(- Previous hash) Tj
T*
(- Current hash) Tj
T*
(- Change summary) Tj
T*
(- Confidence score \(high/medium/low\)) Tj
T*
(- Approval status \(auto-approved/manual-approved/rejected\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#3\) Architecture \(v1\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#A\) Carrier Registry) Tj
T*
(Single registry table \(Google Sheet or JSON\) with one row per carrier source.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Fields:) Tj
T*
(- `carrier_name`) Tj
T*
(- `source_type` \(public_url | portal_url | drive_link\)) Tj
T*
(- `source_url`) Tj
T*
(- `auth_required` \(yes/no\)) Tj
