(- `check_frequency` \(daily | mon-thu | weekly\)) Tj
T*
(- `destination_drive_folder_id`) Tj
T*
(- `parser_type` \(pdf_text | html_text | mixed\)) Tj
T*
(- `auto_approve_threshold` \(e.g., 0.85\)) Tj
T*
(- `owner`) Tj
T*
(- `enabled`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#B\) Watcher Agent \(scheduled\)) Tj
T*
(Runs by cron and loops enabled rows:) Tj
T*
(1. Pull source content) Tj
T*
(2. Normalize text) Tj
T*
(3. Compute checksum/hash) Tj
T*
(4. Compare with last known hash) Tj
T*
(5. If unchanged: log + exit row) Tj
T*
(6. If changed: save new file, run diff summary, score confidence) Tj
T*
(7. Route by approval rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#C\) Diff + QA Agent) Tj
T*
(- Extract text from previous and current versions) Tj
T*
(- Produce concise “What changed” bullets) Tj
T*
(- Score confidence:) Tj
T*
(  - High: structure and key sections matched) Tj
T*
(  - Medium: partial extraction or moderate structural changes) Tj
T*
(  - Low: extraction noise, access issues, or major ambiguity) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#D\) Approval Router) Tj
T*
(- If confidence >= threshold and source is trusted: auto-approve) Tj
T*
(- Else: send to Todd for approval \(Telegram/email\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#E\) Notification Layer) Tj
T*
(- Daily digest of changed carriers) Tj
T*
(- Immediate alert for high-impact changes \(major appetite/underwriting updates\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#4\) Scheduling) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(##Default cadence) Tj
T*
(- Tier 1 carriers \(top volume\): daily 7:15 AM ET) Tj
T*
(- Tier 2 carriers: Mon/Thu 7:30 AM ET) Tj
T*
(- Tier 3 carriers: weekly Fri 8:00 AM ET) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(##Retry policy) Tj
T*
(- Retry failed source fetch up to 3 attempts with backoff) Tj
T*
(- After 3 failures, mark row `needs_attention` and notify owner) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
