(#5\) Approval Rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#Auto-approve when all are true:) Tj
T*
(- Source is trusted and stable) Tj
T*
(- Confidence >= threshold) Tj
T*
(- Change type is minor/moderate \(format refresh, section updates\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#Manual approval required when any are true:) Tj
T*
(- Confidence low/medium below threshold) Tj
T*
(- Auth/session anomaly) Tj
T*
(- Large structure change \(possible parsing mismatch\)) Tj
T*
(- New source/domain not previously approved) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(#6\) Security & Compliance Guardrails) Tj
T*
(- Only monitor sources you are authorized to access.) Tj
T*
(- Store credentials in secure vault; never hardcode in scripts.) Tj
T*
(- Enforce least privilege for agent service account.) Tj
T*
(- Log every access/update event with timestamp and actor.) Tj
T*
(- Preserve previous versions for rollback/comparison.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
